speedupy-native bundles three third-party hash implementations, copied
unchanged into vendor/ from the upstream repositories at the commits below:
the versions SpeeduPy's measurements used. Their licenses apply to their code
and are reproduced in the files named below; the glue code of this package
(src/, csrc/, build.rs, python/) is MIT (see LICENSE).

The copies are never edited. A new version is a new copy of the upstream
files, with this file updated, the reference values regenerated
(tools/gen_vectors.py) and at least a minor version bump, since the hash
values change.

a5hash (vendor/a5hash/a5hash.h)
  Copyright (c) 2025 Aleksey Vaneev
  License: MIT, vendor/a5hash/LICENSE
  Upstream: https://github.com/avaneev/a5hash
  Version: 5.25, tag 5.25, commit 0c37b0b722e20cda2b06cecbe94d748962b99eab (2025-12-12)

MeowHash (vendor/meow_hash/meow_hash_x64_aesni.h)
  (C) Copyright 2018 Molly Rocket, Inc.
  License: zlib, vendor/meow_hash/LICENSE
  Upstream: https://github.com/cmuratori/meow_hash
  Version: 0.5 "calico", commit b080caa7e51576fe3151c8976110df7966fa6a38 (2021-07-02, the
  repository's last commit). The author reclassified 0.5 after a published
  cryptanalysis: not for message authentication or hash tables exposed to
  collision attacks.

MuseAir (vendor/museair/src/lib.rs, vendor/museair/CRATES.IO-README.md,
vendor/museair/Cargo.toml.upstream)
  Copyright (c) K--Aethiax
  License: MIT OR Apache-2.0, as declared in vendor/museair/Cargo.toml.upstream
  Upstream: https://github.com/eternal-io/museair
  Version: 0.4.0, tag v0.4, commit ab293247bf30229e29728566521098908f466bb1 (2025-07-24).
  Later upstream versions (v1, v2, crate 0.6.0, July 2026) are a different
  algorithm and would be a new hash, not an update.

The C/C++ wrappers in csrc/ (a5hash_wrapper.c, meow_wrapper.cpp) were written
for SpeeduPy's original ctypes-based loading and are kept so that the values
match the original shared libraries byte for byte. They came from
https://github.com/JoaoLopez/a5hash (commit 7ff7fa3) and
https://github.com/JoaoLopez/meow_hash (commit beeb71f).
